Finger Command and More The Proxmox series ends with an advanced topic of clustering and high availability. Some readers suggested including Artificial Intelligence in LHB coverage. The rest of the article is available to LHB members only.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/cddb870fba73e5aef16d61ac118fc5b6?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-09-13T06:35:19.000Z"},{"id":"K9aKN9F8p","title":"Clustering and High Availability [Proxmox Series #7]","url":"https://linuxhandbook.com/proxmox-clustering-ha/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/clustering-and-high-availability-proxmox-series-7--k9akn9f8p","summary":"Proxmox uses quorum to determine which node the VMs will be automatically transferred to if a node goes down unexpectedly. If you have at least 3 physical servers in a cluster, you can set up high availability between the three servers. You will also need a NAS or some type of shared storage for this to work correctly.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/e06126d81ae8580a75d1887049dfc45d?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-09-11T10:21:12.000Z"},{"id":"N7R1u8IEF","title":"How to Extract and Create RAR Files in Linux","url":"https://linuxhandbook.com/extract-create-rar-files/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-to-extract-and-create-rar-files-in-linux-n7r1u8ief","summary":"How to extract and create RAR files in Linux is not that complicated. You can easily extract the contents of the RAR file in the present working directory from where you are running the command. Use the gzip command in Linux gzip is one of the most useful but often overlooked utilities.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/01544e91fa291f260af4ae07bce9b0ab?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-09-10T07:13:14.000Z"},{"id":"zYMZdVzJv","title":"Upgrading Proxmox version [Proxmox Series #7]"